    <item>
      <title>dress | taylor swift cover</title>
      <link>//localhost:1313/posts/people_you_meet_outside_of_bars/dress-taylor-swift/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 20 Dec 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>//localhost:1313/posts/people_you_meet_outside_of_bars/dress-taylor-swift/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div style=&#34;position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;iframe allow=&#34;accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share; fullscreen&#34; loading=&#34;eager&#34; referrerpolicy=&#34;strict-origin-when-cross-origin&#34; src=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/embed/bbfzHVyy_w0?autoplay=0&amp;amp;controls=1&amp;amp;end=0&amp;amp;loop=0&amp;amp;mute=0&amp;amp;start=0&#34; style=&#34;position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border:0;&#34; title=&#34;YouTube video&#34;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;i haven’t posted anything on youtube since last march &amp;amp; i’d like to start again. the time away has been for a multitude of reasons, but a significant one is that i kept psyching myself out with the idea that i have to do something Impressive Somehow, so i thought i’d get back into it by just letting myself do something really simple– no video editing, live to tape + some harmonies after the fact, lots &amp;amp; lots &amp;amp; lots of mistakes. i remain as always open to funding for my lesbian jukebox musical entirely hinged on the songs of taylor swift&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
