      <description>&lt;div style=&#34;position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;iframe allow=&#34;accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share; fullscreen&#34; loading=&#34;eager&#34; referrerpolicy=&#34;strict-origin-when-cross-origin&#34; src=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/embed/5QwBAnTqGdk?autoplay=0&amp;amp;controls=1&amp;amp;end=0&amp;amp;loop=0&amp;amp;mute=0&amp;amp;start=0&#34; style=&#34;position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border:0;&#34; title=&#34;YouTube video&#34;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;note from april 12 2023:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;it’s a little hard to discern from my regular under eye bags in the phone camera quality but i had a lingering black eye when i recorded this. i got a lot of those &amp;amp; i told people it’s because i’m clumsy, which is true, but also it’s because i was an alcoholic &amp;amp; taking bad falls in only the way a drunk on ice can. is that a fun cool behind the scenes detail to share now that i’m like a year &amp;amp; a half sober?&lt;/p&gt;</description>
